Theorem matrify_thm : forall A M N:set, A <> Empty -> M <> Empty -> N <> Empty -> forall x :e A :^: idx_n (dimindex M * dimindex N), matrify A M N x = fun i :e idx M => fun j :e idx N => x (minus_nat i 1 * dimindex N + j).
Admitted.

